        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist die maximale Anzahl von Werten, die ein Array in einem Spiel (wie Feinde auf einem Level) halten kann?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Soviel wir wollen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Soviel wir wollen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist ein Element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ein Wert in einem Array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der Zustand eines Arrays</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ein Wert in einem Array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147952,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Weise dem <code>questLog</code> eine Array mit dem Wert <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> zu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Defeat the dragon&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" questLog = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 10 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Quest Log:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(questLog);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Collect 10 coins\"</code> und schließlich <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147953,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle ein Array, das <code>\"forest\"</code> und <code>\"dungeon\"</code> speichert.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levels = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dungeon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levels);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147954,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ inventory ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147955,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Index von <code>\"slime\"</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147956,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aktualisiere das zweite Element zu <code>\"Mage\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"party[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Paladin&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" party = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"party[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(party);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>party[1]</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>\"Mage\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147957,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen letzten Index können wir in diesem Array zugreifen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" checkpointsReached = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147958,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>\"Meg\"</code> an Index <code>0</code> und <code>\"Max\"</code> an Index <code>1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Meg\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Max\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147959,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie greifen wir auf den Wert <code>22</code> in diesem Array zu?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreMilestones = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scoreMilestones[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scoreMilestones(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>scoreMilestones[2]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147960,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es entfernt den letzten Wert eines Arrays</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt den ersten Wert eines Arrays</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt einen zufälligen Wert aus einem Array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es entfernt den letzten Wert eines Arrays.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147961,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es fügt einem Array einen Wert hinzu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es entfernt einen Wert aus einem Array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es erstellt ein Array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es fügt einem Array einen Wert hinzu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147962,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> zu diesem Inventar-Array hinzu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mana Potion&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wooden Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>inventory</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>push</code>, <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147963,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Index von <code>\"Fire Rune\"</code> im Array, nachdem es mit <code>push()</code> hinzugefügt wurde?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" runes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ice Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"runes.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fire Rune&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(runes);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147964,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist der Wert von <code>lastLife</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" extraLives = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastLife = extraLives.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lastLife);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147965,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele Elemente enthält ein leeres Array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147966,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird dieses Code-Snippet in der Konsole anzeigen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bosses = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime King&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin Chief&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Stone Golem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shadow Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bosses.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bosses.length);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147967,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird dieses Code-Snippet in der Konsole anzeigen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lootBag = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lootBag.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lootBag);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">5</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"coin\", \"gem\", \"key\", \"potion\", \"map\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 147968,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird dieses Code-Snippet in der Konsole anzeigen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUps = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;double jump&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(powerUps.length);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>3</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 147969,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass diesen Code-Schnipsel jedes Element im <code>enemies</code>-Array anzeigen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemies.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
